.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ORG LIST"
.SH NAME
hamstik org list \- List organizations you belong to
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik org list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List organizations you belong to
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
